WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:02.752
Is everyone here?

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.337
Gather around.

00:00:06.548 --> 00:00:08.383
I'm sure you already know,

00:00:08.466 --> 00:00:11.344
but a horrible incident happened
at school this morning.

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:14.139
Tem, the actor...

00:00:19.227 --> 00:00:20.729
President!

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:24.149
This is the only place
Tem was in contact with the carnivores.

00:00:24.232 --> 00:00:25.358
And?

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:27.110
Are you suspecting us?

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:30.238
Maybe someone got jealous of him
for getting a good role.

00:00:30.321 --> 00:00:32.574
How dare you say that!

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:34.826
Herbivores are always like this.

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:36.202
Wanna start a fight?

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:38.496
-I can't open these walnuts.
-If a carnivore hurts a herbivore...

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.165
-Where's Legoshi?
-...they would be expelled.

00:00:40.248 --> 00:00:41.124
-Hey.
-Ridiculous!

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:43.918
-Legoshi isn't a nutcracker.
-You're not even worth using my fangs.

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:45.420
-Stop it!
-You're right.

00:00:45.503 --> 00:00:47.464
-You're both stripes.
-Legoshi isn't here.

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:49.966
Where has he gone?

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.972
I'm scared.

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:57.766
Those were eyes looking at prey.

00:00:58.433 --> 00:01:01.978
That wolf's telling me that I'm next.

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:03.688
You're overthinking.

00:01:04.355 --> 00:01:07.275
Legoshi's always been a bit weird.

00:01:07.859 --> 00:01:10.320
You can come see me anytime.

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:13.198
We prosimians are always fun and cheerful.

00:01:14.449 --> 00:01:15.617
Thank you.

00:01:15.658 --> 00:01:17.077
Good night.

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:18.161
Good night.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:45.230
Stay away.

00:01:54.823 --> 00:01:58.910
You pretend to be our friend,
but once you're hungry, we're your food?

00:02:00.578 --> 00:02:02.038
Don't look down on us!

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:05.959
Tem and I are much more...

00:02:09.587 --> 00:02:10.463
Here.

00:02:13.508 --> 00:02:17.303
It's a love letter. For you.

00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:22.684
I waited so we could be alone.

